    "stage": 92,
    "statement": "Severe flooding occurs in Greene...Sumter...and Marengo counties with numerous evacuations required.  "
   },
   {
    "stage": 84,
    "statement": "Some industrial and residential flooding begins just upstream from Demopolis Dam at 88 feet. Widespread flooding in Greene...Marengo...and Sumter counties occurs and some evacuations may be necessary. "
   },
   {
    "stage": 77,
    "statement": "Flooding of numerous cabins and trailers near the river can be expected. "
   },
   {
    "stage": 73,
    "statement": "Some cabins and trailers along the river begin to flood...as well as some secondary roads. "
   },
   {
    "stage": 68,
    "statement": "Flooding of lowlands in the area occurs and cattle should be moved to higher ground. "
   }
